# adf-hx Browse POC — adf-hx Only

**Branch:** `feature/adf-hx-browse-poc`  
This rule applies to all work on the adf-hx browse POC. Do not mix production browse or generic Angular Material into this feature.

**Full architecture:** [`libs/shared/adf-hx-bridge/ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../libs/shared/adf-hx-bridge/ARCHITECTURE.md)

## Architecture (summary)

```
Shell (nuxeo-ui)
  nav + drawer → BrowseAdfHxPocComponent  @  /#/browse-adf-hx?path=…
                      ↓ hxp-* components
                 adf-hx-bridge services (AdfHxDocumentService, …)
                      ↓ NuxeoDocumentApi / NuxeoQueryApi
                 nuxeo-client (BrowseService, DocumentDetailService)
                      ↓
                 Nuxeo REST
```

- **POC page:** `libs/features/browse/src/lib/browse-adf-hx-poc/` — wires tabs, filters, panel; no Material.
- **Bridge:** `libs/shared/adf-hx-bridge/` — all `hxp-*` UI + AdfHx services + Nuxeo→Hx mapper.
- **Production browse** (`/#/browse`) is unchanged; path sync and `browseReturn=adf-hx` helpers live in `browse-path.utils.ts`.
- **Scope A:** read-only — write actions show a notice; tabs/load/export are implemented.

## UI — `hxp-*` only

- Use components from `@agentic-ui/shared/adf-hx-bridge` (`hxp-folder-header`, `hxp-breadcrumb`, `hxp-domain-hint`, `hxp-browse-toolbar`, `hxp-document-list`, `hxp-browse-nav-drawer`, `hxp-browse-nav-tree`, `hxp-icon`, `hxp-spinner`).
- **Never** use Angular Material (`mat-*`, `Mat*Module`), Satori (`sat-*`), or production browse UI in the POC page or its bridge components.
- Side nav: use **`hxp-browse-nav-tree`** (nested folder tree). The legacy Material `hxp-document-tree` was deleted in Phase 0.
- Icons/spinners: **`hxp-icon`** / **`hxp-spinner`** only — no `mat-icon` / `mat-spinner`.
- Form controls: native HTML (`input`, `select`, `button`) styled in bridge SCSS — no `mat-form-field`, `mat-datepicker`, etc.
- CSS tokens: use **`--hxp-*`** only — never `--mat-sys-*` in bridge SCSS. Tokens are aliased from Satori in `apps/nuxeo-ui/src/styles/hxp-theme.scss` (after `@include sat.theme`).

## Data — AdfHx bridge only

- Feature page and nav tree must call **`AdfHxDocumentService`** (and other bridge services), not `BrowseService` or `DocumentDetailService` directly.
- Document model: **`Document`** from `@hylandsoftware/hxcs-js-client`.
- Routing/navigation: **`NuxeoDocumentRouterService`** + `AdfHxBrowseContextService`.
- Providers: `ADF_HX_NUXEO_BRIDGE_PROVIDERS` on the feature page and nav drawer.

## Shell integration

- App shell may host `<hxp-browse-nav-drawer>` but must **not** render Material chrome (title/refresh) for adf-hx browse — the drawer component owns its header.
- Do not import production `BrowseComponent` patterns into the POC route.

## PR blocker

Any new Material, Satori, direct `BrowseService` usage, or production browse component in the above paths must be removed before merge.
